Primary-source archive for clean-room pass 17.

Provenance: official arXiv:2001.10914v2 source archive, downloaded from
https://arxiv.org/e-print/2001.10914v2.  The extracted source tarball was
`/tmp/xhm-src/src.tar`, SHA-256
`cc05e7dbff7bf0c42a10b7da1f4840eefc55b252168d6bfb085155a7bdc5318e`.
The source TeX used for the derivation is `hmc2.tex`, SHA-256
`5c7132720db24d9caaa804f53d6961b075996cacee00b3ce0a51865a6dbf107e`.

The archived files are only the parameter-space phase-derivative fits used
by the paper's intermediate reconstruction: p1--p5 for the six-node
nonmixing construction (the existing pass-14 archive already contains p6)
and p1--p4 for the four-node (3,2) construction.  Mathematica notebooks,
unrelated Lambda/ringdown/shift fits, and the source archive's unused 32 p5
and p6 files are intentionally not copied here.

